{"script":"yd_011_04-备份","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1b","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":160,"y":-206,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1b","layer":"chara2","scaleY":1,"x":160,"transTime":300,"y":-206,"trans":true,"bright":1,"noOut":false,"img":"chara011_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]在遇见莉拉首座之前……缇莎还不太明白“魔法”的含义。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]如果能够掌握这份力量的话，莉拉首座不在，缇莎也能依靠自己在深渊里活下去。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]虽然现在还没有那么厉害啦，但是缇莎稍微能够感受到一些变化！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara011_1_face_chara011_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]{myName}的身边也有哦，和米托拉小姐站在一起的时候能够感受到！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"缇莎","text":"[show]好像温和的湖水和凉凉的风，缇莎以后就能明白到底是什么了吧？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"缇莎的魔法"}